          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP241 Edmonton - Kensington Village

&lt;strong&gt;Posted:&lt;/strong&gt; N53° 35.520' W113° 32.458'

&lt;strong&gt;MyGPSr:&lt;/strong&gt; N53° 35.522' W113° 32.459'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I (FOUND) this one knowing it had been found by others during the April 2017 province-wide cap finding frenzy. That made me confident I'd make a find and sure enough after just a little rambling in this very public spot, I was able to spot the cap, take my pics and be on my way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
