          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP241 Edmonton - Kensington Village

In North Edmonton grabbing some BCPs before the end of the month. Last one of 6 BCPs for today. Bit of mud to clean off but still another easy find. Traffic didn't seem to pay me any notice. 

Thanks outforthehunt for another BCP. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
